   <narrative xml:lang="PT">BRA/23/011 - Brasil Agenda 2030</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">The general objective of this Project is to support Brazil in achieving the 2030 Agenda by providing subsidies for the analysis, planning and execution of actions aimed at strengthening participation and social inclusion in the process of monitoring and implementing the 17 Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) in the country and the institutional strengthening of the National Commission for the SDGs (CNODS) and the General Secretariat of the Presidency of the Republic (SGPR).</narrative>
  </description>
